    "address": "Flaming Grill and Supreme Buffet, 1773 Grand Ave, Baldwin, NY 11510, United States",
    "desc": "The Exact Coordinates\nDo not wander aimlessly. This monumental, sprawling cathedral of global culinary abundance is anchored beautifully within the expansive, vibrant retail corridors of New York, operating as a glowing beacon of endless dining.\n\nThe Architectural Scale\nThis is not a cramped dining room. The building is a massive, beautifully designed culinary hall featuring soaring ceilings, brilliant ambient lighting, and sprawling, gleaming buffet islands that perfectly showcase an incredible abundance of food.\n\nThe Hibachi Theater\nThe absolute star of the dining room is the massive, roaring hibachi grill. Watch the open kitchen carefully as master chefs brilliantly toss fresh, vibrant vegetables and premium meats over towering open flames in a stunning display of culinary theater.\n\nThe Sushi Gallery\nStep up to the beautifully illuminated glass displays. The chefs perform a brilliant, continuous culinary dance, meticulously rolling fresh, jewel-toned maki and slicing delicate, brilliantly colored sashimi in a spotless, open-concept sushi bar.\n\nThe Wok Mastery\nObserve the heavy, traditional woks resting over the roaring fires. The kitchen meticulously maintains a continuous, high-heat cooking cycle, creating the deeply savory, irreplaceable flavor profile known as wok hei in every massive tray of noodles.\n\nThe Seafood Colossus\nApproach the stunning, brightly lit cold bars. The culinary team masterfully displays towering tiers of premium chilled seafood, featuring endless, beautifully arranged plates of fresh shellfish and perfectly seasoned cold salads resting on pristine ice.\n\nThe Carving Station\nLook for the brilliant, warmly lit carving stations. The culinary team masterfully slices towering, flawlessly roasted cuts of beef and deeply caramelized poultry, serving them seamlessly alongside rich, deeply savory house-made gravies.\n\nThe Dim Sum Baskets\nDo not ignore the towering bamboo baskets. The kitchen meticulously maintains a roaring, continuous steam cycle, presenting beautifully delicate dumplings and perfectly fluffy, warm bao buns that deliver a flawless, traditional savory bite.\n\nThe Strategic Plating\nApproach the massive islands methodically. Build a flawless foundation of light, chilled seafood and fresh sushi before seamlessly transitioning to the rich, deeply savory hot dishes and complex, sizzling hibachi plates.\n\nThe Shared Tasting\nBecause the sheer volume of options is gloriously colossal, beautifully coordinate plate selections with a travel companion. This allows for a seamless, perfectly balanced sampling of the absolute best of the global menu in a single visit without generating excess waste.\n\nThe Culinary Weight\nThese massive, richly layered plates carry a dense, deeply satisfying payload. They are perfectly engineered to effortlessly fuel a massive afternoon of exploring the expansive retail avenues and sprawling parks of the surrounding New York landscape.\n\nThe Dessert Monument\nAlways save room for the grand finale. The dessert pavilion is a towering, flawlessly constructed architectural marvel built with beautifully layered cakes, mountains of fresh, vibrant fruit, and cascades of rich, cold ice cream.\n\nThe Chocolate Fountain\nThe centerpiece of the dessert station is an absolute visual triumph. A towering, brilliantly cascading chocolate fountain flows continuously, allowing you to flawlessly coat fresh strawberries and soft marshmallows in a rich, glossy layer of warm cocoa.\n\nThe Macro Detail\nBefore taking the first bite, activate your camera's dedicated macro mode. Get incredibly close to the towering plates to beautifully capture the glistening, savory sauces of the hibachi grill and the brilliant, vibrant colors of the fresh sushi rolls.\n\nThe Transit Approach\nTransit to the sprawling retail complexes is beautifully efficient. Effortlessly board the regional bus lines or utilize the massive, brilliantly illuminated parking concourses designed to easily handle the incredible volume of diners visiting this culinary destination.",
    "summary": "Flaming Grill & Supreme Buffet serves Chinese, Japanese, American, and international dishes, including sushi, hibachi, seafood, and desserts.",
