    "website": "https://taogroup.com/venues/legasea-bar-grill-new-york/",
    "address": "Legasea Bar & Grill, 485 7th Ave, New York, NY 10018, United States",
    "summary": "A high-energy modern brasserie inside the Moxy Times Square famous for its viral unlimited ribeye steak and endless french fries special.",
    "desc": "The Exact Coordinates\nDo not wander aimlessly around the frantic blocks of Penn Station looking for a traditional, quiet steak joint. This vibrant, high-energy modern brasserie is brilliantly anchored on the ground level of the bustling Moxy Times Square hotel directly at 485 7th Avenue.\n\nThe Unlimited Ribeye\nYou absolutely must command the highly celebrated, massive unlimited ribeye special if you arrive with a serious appetite. The kitchen flawlessly and continuously delivers beautifully charred, perfectly sliced premium steak directly to your table until you completely tap out.\n\nThe Endless Fries\nDo not pace yourself when it comes to the legendary side dish accompanying the massive steak. The brilliantly crispy, heavily seasoned french fries are also completely bottomless, ensuring a perfectly salty, golden-brown crunch with every single bite of beef.\n\nThe Temperature Strategy\nWhen commanding the endless steak special, confidently request your continuous cuts to be fired exactly at medium-rare. This precise temperature beautifully maximizes the tenderness and rich, deeply savory juices of the meat during a massive marathon meal.\n\nThe Signature Beignets\nIf you need a brilliant starter before the massive wave of steak arrives, command an order of their spicy crab beignets. These perfectly fried, golden-brown spheres flawlessly blend rich, sweet crab meat with a sharp, fiery kick that instantly wakes up the palate.\n\nThe Towering Plateau\nDo not ignore the spectacular raw bar if you want a lighter, deeply refreshing contrast to the heavy beef. The expert chefs brilliantly stack towering layers of freshly shucked oysters and massive chilled shrimp over a brilliant bed of crushed ice.\n\nThe Woven Aesthetic\nAdmire the incredible, highly stylized nautical interior design the moment you walk through the doors. The massive dining room is beautifully blanketed in intricate woven cane chairs, brilliant polished brass accents, and deeply rich leather banquettes that scream modern luxury.\n\nThe TAO Group Vibe\nEmbrace the undeniably high-octane, spirited atmosphere that flawlessly defines this hospitality powerhouse. A live, high-energy soundtrack seamlessly pumps through the dining room, effortlessly transforming a standard dinner service into a vibrant, bustling nightlife prelude.\n\nThe Pre-Game Window\nUtilize this massive venue as the absolute perfect staging ground before a major evening event. Its immediate proximity to Madison Square Garden makes it an incredibly strategic, highly reliable spot to secure a heavy meal before a high-energy concert or game.\n\nThe Cocktail Elevation\nElevate your massive steak dinner by securing a highly engineered craft cocktail from the bustling main bar. The mixologists brilliantly utilize bright, fresh citrus and botanical spirits to create incredibly refreshing flavor profiles that cut right through the rich beef.\n\nThe Group Dining Strategy\nBecause the unlimited ribeye deal is completely engineered for massive appetites, gather a highly dedicated crew of friends for the visit. Tackling an endless mountain of premium steak and fries is the absolute best way to experience the high-energy nature of the room.\n\nThe Dress Code Protocol\nKeep a sharp, stylish approach when selecting an outfit for the evening, especially on bustling weekends. Leave the athletic wear behind in favor of a sleek, smart-casual look to seamlessly match the incredibly trendy, highly polished crowd filling the banquettes.\n\nThe Booking Priority\nDo not rely on walk-in availability for a prime dinner window, as the highly viral unlimited steak special commands a massive nightly crowd. Secure a confirmed table weeks in advance via their dedicated booking portal to completely bypass the sprawling lobby queues.\n\nThe Sizzle Capture\nFor a brilliant, cinematic social media clip, use a slow-motion video frame rate exactly when the first massive platter of sliced ribeye hits the table. Flawlessly freeze the beautiful, glistening char on the beef resting against the massive mountain of golden fries.\n\nThe Magic Hour Pivot\nOnce you finally surrender to the endless steak and settle the bill, take a highly strategic elevator ride to instantly extend the evening. Head directly up to the iconic Magic Hour Rooftop Bar & Lounge to seamlessly transition into a massive nightlife party.",
